      "section": "Plate",
      "order": 6,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "A synthetic 2 x 3 plate written as one OME-Zarr plate store (NGFF 0.4): each column gets a dose of the same compound, so cells get fewer and brighter in GFP from column 1 to column 3. Pick a well on the left and the viewer opens that well's field; the cells drawn over it are the table's rows of that well. Open the whole plate in vizarr from the viewer's \"Open in\" menu.\n",
